<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound o/n rate average falls, weekly up.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound o/n rate average falls, weekly up.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound ruled on Tuesday between 8-1/4 and 9-1/8 percent after Monday's range of 8-1/4 to 9-1/2 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>Average one-week rates rose to between 8-5/8 and 9-1/4 percent from between 8-1/8 and 9-1/8 percent on Monday.</p>
<p>The bankers said that public-sector banks kept their official minimum lending rate steady at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
